# Ignore reference and recon material

# The reference project is a read-only upstream clone (MIT), used only as a
# design-system source. It is not part of the build.
.reference/

# Local recon artifacts: extracted bundles, pretty-printed CSS, screenshots and
# the asar extraction helpers. Regenerable, never shipped.
.repro/

# Scratch workbench: font-calibration probes, one-off scan scripts, extracted
# client bundles, probe logs. Same category as .repro/ — local, regenerable, and
# in places a verbatim copy of host code, which must not be redistributed.
.work/

# Runtime output of the theme's long-paste feature: the plugin writes each
# converted paste here as a real file in the workspace, so the composer can
# reference it as @path. Per-user content, never committed.
.dsh-paste/

# Scratch and tooling
node_modules/
*.log

# Screenshot tool output pasted into the repo root by accident. Real screenshots
# live under assets/ and are referenced by name from the README.
SnowShot_*.png

# Harness session metadata written into the workspace root by the app itself.
# It is one JSON line holding the session UUID and the absolute workspace path —
# per-machine state, not repository content. Anchored to the root so a file of
# the same name deeper in the tree is not silently ignored; `.work/` above only
# covers the directory, which is why this one slipped into a commit.
/.work-session.jsonl

# Commercial font working copies: no redistribution grant.
#
# WHY EACH FILE IS NAMED INSTEAD OF GLOBBING THE DIRECTORY. `fonts/` also holds
# the two SIL OFL Noto subsets that the published bundle inlines, and those must
# stay trackable — they are the source of shipped bytes. A `fonts/*.woff2` rule
# would silence both categories, so the six commercial faces are listed one by
# one. They remain on disk as the developer's own working copies; only their git
# tracking is removed. See market/PUBLISHING.md §5 and
# plugins/cds-theme/licenses/NOTICE.md.
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicSans-Roman-Web.woff2
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicSans-Italic-Web.woff2
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicSerif-Roman-Web.woff2
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicSerif-Italic-Web.woff2
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicMono-Roman-Web.woff2
plugins/cds-theme/fonts/AnthropicMono-Italic-Web.woff2
